        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12630,
        "area_px": 100776,
        "density": 0.12533,
        "chars": 188,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.89
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100,
        799,
        1577,
        909
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on June 14, 2022, the federal court in *Nunez* approved the *Nunez Action Plan*, which \u201crepresents a way to move forward with concrete measures now to address the ongoing crisis at Rikers Island\u201d; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1288,
          "min": -0.7176
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 57,
          "mean": -0.022,
          "min": -0.6326
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13413,
        "area_px": 143412,
        "density": 0.09353,
        "chars": 209,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.58
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100,
        954,
        1581,
        1140
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, while there has been improvement in excessive staff absenteeism, the Department of Correction's (DOC's) staffing levels continue to contribute to a rise in unrest and disorder and create a serious risk to the necessary maintenance and delivery of sanitary conditions; access to basic services including showers, meals, visitation, religious services, commissary, and recreation; and prompt processing at intake; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1506,
          "min": -1.1539
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 79,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0076
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 27000,
        "area_px": 240312,
        "density": 0.11235,
        "chars": 424,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.7
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100,
        1185,
        1577,
        1263
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, this Order is given to prioritize compliance with the *Nunez Action Plan* and to address the effects of DOC's staffing levels, the conditions at DOC facilities, and health operations; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.0787,
          "min": -0.5648
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0011,
          "min": -0.043
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13105,
        "area_px": 102068,
        "density": 0.12839,
        "chars": 196,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.96
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100,
        1302,
        1577,
        1378
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, additional reasons for requiring the measures continued in this Order are set forth in Emergency Executive Order No. 140; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1007,
          "min": -0.8866
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
